# Secrets

| Path | Use |
|------|-----|
| `.agent-workflow/secrets/integrations/` | Optional `.env` files for CLIs you add |
| `.agent-workflow/secrets/local/` | Active profile markers, local overrides |

Never @-attach `secrets/` in the IDE. Never commit secrets. Redact in chat and issue comments.
